      "writtenOn": "2022-04-04T08:33:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We already have a tweak in the build scripts to force-export the __traceiter_* variants of all tracepoints: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/build/+/refs/heads/master/abi/extract_symbols#133\n\nIs this not applicable here?",
      "parentUuid": "3dbcb923_d35a34c6",
      "revId": "f1ae03df3323a0e8fc97b47aafb104fe8a9cd1b5",
