      "writtenOn": "2022-04-05T09:06:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Aha, good point, the __traceiter_* stufff defines the \u0027in-kernel\u0027 ABI, which is what we care about for vendor hooks, but that is distinct from the *userspace* ABI which is what BPF needs. Fair enough, I don\u0027t have any other suggestions.",
      "parentUuid": "fe605831_9885fa24",
      "revId": "f1ae03df3323a0e8fc97b47aafb104fe8a9cd1b5",
